# Tilmelding — Agent Rules

## Org conventions
Read `.agents/rules/rules.md` for org-wide conventions before proceeding.
Everything in that file applies here unless explicitly overridden below.

---

## This repo

**Purpose:** Nathejk tilmelding, user facing frontend with dedicated api (backend for frontend style)
**Group:** Core

### Services

| Service | Technology | Dev target | Local URL |
|---|---|---|---|
| frontend | Vue 3 (TS) | `ui-dev` | `https://tilmelding.local.nathejk.dk` |
| bff | Go | `base` | internal only |

### Key files
- `docker/Dockerfile` — multistage build (dev targets: `ui-dev`, `base`; prod target: `prod`)
- `docker-compose.yml` — dev environment
- `roadmap/tasks/TASKS.md` — task board conventions
- `roadmap/prd/` — Product Requirements Documents (see `roadmap/prd/README.md`)

---

## Repo-specific conventions

- All endpoints must have OpenAPI annotations
- New features and significant changes require a PRD (`prd` skill) before implementation
